^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎もし生まれ変わるなら何になりたい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└女の子＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎自分の好きなところ・嫌いなところは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└好きなところは、チャレンジ精神＊嫌いなところは、ネガティブ＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎メンバーに言われると嬉しい言葉は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└良かったよーとか(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎なみころのMVはどこでとった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└どこやろー？九十九里浜らへんかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえずここまで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問答えてくれてありがと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木充のかたいっぱーいだったね(*^^*)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいっありがとう(〃・ω・〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなも、乃木充だったよ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日、乃木充だったからめっちゃいいおもいで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/4417438/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仕事で大変だったかた、お疲れ様ですっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/4417438/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろまんのコーデ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragrap